<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nabisco started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nabisco started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst George Staphos has started coverage of Nabisco Holdings Corp with a rating of attractive, a source at the brokerage said on Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the packaged food company closed on Thursday at 40-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
